    "design-system/.config/preferences.json": "{\"example\":true}\n",
    "design-system/.gitignore": "node_modules/\n",
    "design-system/README.md": "# Khor Lab\n\nThis file is fixture data. The App uses its production editor and Markdown renderer.\n\n行内公式：\\(a+b\\) 与 $E=mc^2$。\n\n\\[\n\\sum_{i=1}^{n} i = \\frac{n(n+1)}{2}\n\\]\n\n- 中文输入、选区、撤销与保存\n- 文件树、提交历史与阅读位置\n",
    "design-system/design.md": "# 设计记录\n\n头像表达身份，类型图标由正式组件按设备事实选择。\n",
    "design-system/docs/formulas.md": "# 公式\n\n行内：\\(x^2+y^2=z^2\\)，以及 $a+b$。\n\n\\[\n\\int_0^1 x^2\\,dx = \\frac{1}{3}\n\\]\n",
    "design-system/docs/中文说明.md": "# 导航说明\n\n轻推预选，松手确认。回到原位置松手保留当前。\n",
    "design-system/notes.md": "# 会议记录\n\n本周任务：整理目录导航、移动端输入和提交阅读体验。\n",
    "design-system/package.json": "{\"name\":\"khor-lab-workspace\",\"private\":true}\n",
    "design-system/plan.md": "# 验收计划\n\n1. 切换会话和标签页\n2. 打开文件并保存草稿\n3. 分页浏览提交历史\n",
    "design-system/report.md": "# 实验报告\n\n| 场景 | 状态 |\n| --- | --- |\n| 窄屏布局 | 待验收 |\n| 原生键盘 | 单独验收 |\n",
    "design-system/src/CodeEditor.tsx": "import {EditorState} from '@codemirror/state';\nimport {keymap} from '@codemirror/view';\nimport {defaultKeymap,history,historyKeymap} from '@codemirror/commands';\n\nconst extensions = [history(),keymap.of([...historyKeymap,...defaultKeymap])];\n\nexport function createEditor(doc: string) {\n  return EditorState.create({doc,extensions});\n}\n",
    "design-system/src/app.ts": "export const title = '完整 App Lab';\n",
    "design-system/src/navigation.ts": "export const navigation = {preview: true, confirmOnRelease: true};\n",
    "project/.config/preferences.json": "{\"example\":true}\n",
